 "u02d4.c1": {
  "pick": 3,
  "second": "1 (borderline: 開発するに加えて does turn up in business speech, but the standard form is 開発することに加えて)",
  "note": "The item hinges on form. ばかりか is ruled out before an intention (高めていきたい), and に加えて does not normally follow a bare verb (needs 開発することに加えて), so のみならず is the clean answer. If the key is 1 on a 'のみならず cannot take volition' rule, it contradicts u02d4.d4, where である＋に加えて has to be wrong for the same form reason."
 },
